      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Tbh, when I heard of contacts, i thought you could set parameter values from sender to receiver. Was disappointed that the few ideas I brainstormed wouldn’t be possible.\nI think this would be a great addition to provide more cross-featured/compatible avatars. One of my ideas I brainstormed before jumping into Avatar Dynamics was to sync 2 avatars parameters with handholding.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
